38:## Build & typecheck
39-
40:**Stale dist gives a false green typecheck.** `packages/server` typechecks against the *built* `dist` of `@lobu/core`, not its source. If you change a `@lobu/core` contract and only run `make typecheck`, the green is meaningless. Run `make build-packages` first on any PR touching core contracts, and never `--admin`-merge past a typecheck check that has not reported.
